{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04472","headline":"魏氏园林人赋一物得秋亭萱草 · 陈子昂","name":"魏氏园林人赋一物得秋亭萱草","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时幽径里，荣耀杂春丛。\n今来玉墀上，销歇畏秋风。\n细叶犹含绿，鲜花未吐红。\n忘忧谁见赏，空此北堂中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}